                      </button>
                      <input
                        accept=".json,application/json"
                        data-testid="import-theme-file"
                        hidden=""
                        type="file"
                      />
                      <span
                        class="hint"
                      >
                        A theme file is JSON with 
                        <code>
                          name
                        </code>
                        , 
                        <code>
                          type
                        </code>
                         (dark or light), an optional
                         
                        <code>
                          extends
                        </code>
                         (a built-in theme name) and the 
                        <code>
                          colors
                        </code>
                         and 
                        <code>
                          terminalColors
                        </code>
                         
                        it overrides. Export a theme to get a complete starting point.
                      </span>
